lwidth=\"142\" style=\"width: 142px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13001</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"368\" style=\"width: 368px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传的文件不存在，上传失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"142\" style=\"width: 142px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13002</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"368\" style=\"width: 368px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>包名不属于当前开发者</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"142\" style=\"width: 142px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13003</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"368\" style=\"width: 368px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请检查文件是否正常，文件上传失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"142\" style=\"width: 142px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13004</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"368\" style=\"width: 368px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>文件上传服务异常，请稍后再试</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"142\" style=\"width: 142px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13005</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"368\" style=\"width: 368px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icon图片类型错误，支持png</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"142\" style=\"width: 142px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13006</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"368\" style=\"width: 368px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icon文件大小不能超过500KB</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"142\" style=\"width: 142px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13007</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"368\" style=\"width: 368px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icon文件尺寸不低于256*256，不超过512*512</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"142\" style=\"width: 142px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20008</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"368\" style=\"width: 368px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>必填参数不能为空</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>","versionCode":10,"updateTime":1782291019000,"bread